{"seq":1,"slug":"grid-scale-storage-technologies","title":"电网级储能技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/energy-storage-systems/grid-scale-storage-technologies","wordCount":2179,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"电网级储能技术\">电网级储能技术</h1><p>2026 年 5 月，BloombergNEF 宣布全球储能正式迈入「100 GW 时代」——仅 2025 一年新增装机就达到约 106 GW（<a href=\"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/05/11/bloombergnef-confirms-energy-storage-has-reached-the-100-gw-era/\">ess-news</a>）。这个数字背后是一个被磷酸铁锂（LFP）几乎垄断、却又在百小时级长时储能上裂变出多条技术路线的产业。电网级储能不再是「给风光配个电池」的附属品，而是承担调频、惯量、容量、套利等多重角色的独立电力资产。本文拆解当前主流与新兴的储能技术、它们的成本与适用时长，以及把电池接入电网的功率变换与并网控制环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-按放电时长划分技术象限\">核心概念：按放电时长划分技术象限</h2><p>理解电网级储能，最有用的一把尺子不是化学体系，而是「放电时长」——系统能以额定功率持续放电多久。功率（MW）决定瞬间能顶多大的缺口，能量（MWh）决定能顶多久，二者之比即时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = E / P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>。一个 100 MW / 400 MWh 的系统时长为 4 小时，这正是当前 LFP 储能的甜区。</p>\n<p>不同时长对应完全不同的技术与商业逻辑：秒到分钟级拼功率与响应速度（调频、惯量），小时级拼度电成本（峰谷套利、容量），十小时以上拼边际储能成本 $/kWh（应对连续阴雨、季节性波动）。下图按时长把主流技术归位：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[电网级储能&lt;br/&gt;按放电时长分类] --&gt; B[秒-分钟级&lt;br/&gt;功率型]&#10;    A --&gt; C[2-6 小时&lt;br/&gt;能量型主力]&#10;    A --&gt; D[8-100 小时&lt;br/&gt;长时储能 LDES]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[飞轮 / 超级电容&lt;br/&gt;调频/惯量]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[LFP 锂电&lt;br/&gt;占新增约 90%]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[钠离子电池&lt;br/&gt;2026 进入中试]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[全钒液流&lt;br/&gt;最成熟 LDES]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[铁-空气电池&lt;br/&gt;百小时/超低成本]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[压缩空气 CAES]\">flowchart TD\n    A[电网级储能&lt;br/&gt;按放电时长分类] --&gt; B[秒-分钟级&lt;br/&gt;功率型]\n    A --&gt; C[2-6 小时&lt;br/&gt;能量型主力]\n    A --&gt; D[8-100 小时&lt;br/&gt;长时储能 LDES]\n    B --&gt; B1[飞轮 / 超级电容&lt;br/&gt;调频/惯量]\n    C --&gt; C1[LFP 锂电&lt;br/&gt;占新增约 90%]\n    C --&gt; C2[钠离子电池&lt;br/&gt;2026 进入中试]\n    D --&gt; D1[全钒液流&lt;br/&gt;最成熟 LDES]\n    D --&gt; D2[铁-空气电池&lt;br/&gt;百小时/超低成本]\n    D --&gt; D3[压缩空气 CAES]</pre><p>下表汇总各技术在 2026 年的关键参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>典型时长</th>\n<th>装机成本（参考）</th>\n<th>循环寿命</th>\n<th>往返效率</th>\n<th>成熟度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LFP 锂电</td>\n<td>2–6 h</td>\n<td>中国约 90–130 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi><mtext>；美国</mtext><mn>230</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>320</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">/kWh；美国 230–320</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">；美国</span><span class=\"mord\">230–320</span></span></span></span></span>/kWh（4h 交钥匙）</td>\n<td>6000+</td>\n<td>85–90%</td>\n<td>大规模商用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钠离子电池</td>\n<td>2–6 h</td>\n<td>接近 LFP，量产爬坡中</td>\n<td>4000+</td>\n<td>~83%（中试实测）</td>\n<td>2026 中试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全钒液流</td>\n<td>4–12 h</td>\n<td>300–500 $/kWh</td>\n<td>20000+</td>\n<td>70–80%</td>\n<td>商用（小批量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁-空气</td>\n<td>100 h</td>\n<td>目标 ~20 $/kWh</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>~50%</td>\n<td>示范/中试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>飞轮</td>\n<td>秒–15 min</td>\n<td>高（$/kWh）</td>\n<td>~100 万次</td>\n<td>85–90%</td>\n<td>利基商用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本数据来自 <a href=\"https://www.polinovelbess.com/info/grid-scale-battery-storage-2026-costs-technolo-103489640.html\">polinovel</a>、<a href=\"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/01/27/analyst-delivers-five-trends-to-look-for-in-global-energy-storage-in-2026/\">ess-news</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.patsnap.com/resources/blog/articles/energy-storage-2026-iron-air-vanadium-flow-caes/\">patsnap</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lfp-标准化-积木块-统治能量型市场\">LFP：标准化「积木块」统治能量型市场</h2><p>2025–2026 年，LFP 在全球公用事业级 BESS 新增中拿下约 90%，新签约项目占比一度接近 95%（<a href=\"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/01/27/analyst-delivers-five-trends-to-look-for-in-global-energy-storage-in-2026/\">ess-news</a>、<a href=\"https://enkiai.com/batteries/mega-battery-tech-2026-why-lfp-ai-rule-grid-storage\">enkiai</a>）。它胜出的原因不是能量密度——在这点上三元（NMC）更高——而是三件事的组合：成本（中国交钥匙 4 小时系统已低至约 90–130 $/kWh）、循环寿命（6000 次以上）、以及最关键的热稳定性。LFP 的橄榄石结构在受热分解时释氧远少于 NMC，热失控阈值更高，这对于把成千上万只电芯密集堆在集装箱里的电网项目是决定性的安全优势。</p>\n<p>2026 年另一个结构性变化是市场从「定制化项目工程」转向「工厂预制的标准化积木块」（<a href=\"https://www.polinovelbess.com/info/grid-scale-battery-storage-2026-costs-technolo-103489640.html\">polinovel</a>）。20 尺集装箱式 BESS 单元（典型 5 MWh 级，部分已到 6 MWh+）出厂即带电芯、温控、消防、PCS 接口，现场只需吊装、接线、并网。这把单位平准化储能成本（LCOS）压到约 65 $/MWh 量级，使储能套利在越来越多电力市场单独盈利。</p>\n<p>需要注意「容量衰减与扩容」（augmentation）。电池每年衰减，为保证项目全周期内仍满足合同容量，运营方通常预留空间并在第 5–8 年补装电芯。设计时常用衰减模型估算：若年衰减率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，则第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 年可用能量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_n = E_0 (1-r)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，扩容计划据此排期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"钠离子与铁基-摆脱锂依赖的两条路\">钠离子与铁基：摆脱锂依赖的两条路</h2><p>2026 被多家机构称为「钠离子、铁-空气、固态电池首次走出实验室进入商业中试」的一年（<a href=\"https://www.patsnap.com/resources/blog/articles/energy-storage-2026-iron-air-vanadium-flow-caes/\">patsnap</a>）。驱动力是供应链——锂、钴的地缘集中与价格波动让电网运营方寻求「锂之外」的选项，而钠、铁都是地壳丰度极高、几乎无供应风险的元素。</p>\n<p>钠离子电池（SIB）与 LFP 工艺高度兼容，可复用现有产线。加州 Inlyte Energy 的铁-钠（iron-sodium）路线计划 2026 年初在 Southern Company 位于阿拉巴马 Wilsonville 的储能测试场部署首批系统，工厂测试中往返效率达到 83%，已进入高性能锂电的区间（<a href=\"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/05/26/inlyte-energy-plans-pilot-projects-to-prove-its-iron-sodium-battery-technology-for-aidc-and-ess-applications/\">ess-news</a>、<a href=\"https://electrek.co/2025/12/11/iron-sodium-grid-batteries-just-took-a-big-step-toward-us-rollout/\">electrek</a>）。GM 也与 Peak Energy 合作推动下一代储能的规模化（<a href=\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/peak-energy-and-general-motors-partner-to-scale-next-generation-energy-storage-technology-for-the-grid-302795688.html\">prnewswire</a>）。</p>\n<p>铁-空气电池走的是另一极端——超长时、超低成本，代价是低效率。它以金属铁为负极、空气中的氧为正极活性物质，放电即「铁生锈」、充电即「还原」，体积容量密度约 10000 Wh/L，目标成本低至约 20 $/kWh，但往返效率仅约 50%（<a href=\"https://www.patsnap.com/resources/blog/articles/iron-air-battery-technology-landscape-2026/\">patsnap</a>）。2026 年最具标志性的项目是 Google 宣布在明尼苏达数据中心部署全球最大铁-空气电池：30 GWh、100 小时放电时长（<a href=\"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/02/25/30-gwh-100-hour-duration-google-to-deploy-worlds-largest-iron-air-battery-for-minnesota-data-center/\">ess-news</a>）。它不与 LFP 竞争小时级套利，而是补位「连续多日无风无光」的可靠性缺口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"功率变换与并网-从-跟网-到-构网\">功率变换与并网：从「跟网」到「构网」</h2><p>电池存的是直流，电网跑的是交流，二者之间是功率变换系统（PCS）——本质是双向逆变器。它的额定功率与电池能量之比定义了系统 C 倍率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = P / E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>，一个 4 小时系统约为 0.25C，调频用的功率型系统可能到 1C 甚至更高。PCS 的控制策略，正在经历从「跟网」（grid-following, GFL）到「构网」（grid-forming, GFM）的范式切换。</p>\n<p>跟网逆变器像「随波逐流的浮标」：它锁相到电网已有的电压频率，再注入电流。当电网里同步发电机（火电、水电的旋转质量）越来越少、新能源占比越来越高时，电网失去了天然的电压频率「锚」，跟网设备越多反而越不稳。构网逆变器则像「定锚的船桩」：它主动设定并维持电压与频率，在故障时提供短路电流、阻尼振荡，并在频率事件发生的毫秒级内注入有功（<a href=\"https://www.twaice.com/industry-technology/grid-forming-inverters-bess-operations\">twaice</a>、<a href=\"https://modoenergy.com/research/en/grid-forming-gfm-grid-following-bess-batteries-ienrtia-fault-level-voltage-current-stability-australia-germany-gb-neso-momentanreserve-march-2026\">modoenergy</a>）。</p>\n<p>2026 年政策与市场正把构网从「锦上添花」变成「硬性要求」。德国将于 2026 年启动惯量服务市场，为构网 BESS 开辟新收入流（<a href=\"https://www.hsfkramer.com/notes/energy/2025-posts/germany-to-launch-inertia-service-market-in-2026-new-revenue-stream-for-grid-forming-bess\">hsfkramer</a>）；美国得州 ERCOT 推出 2500 万美元的构网 BESS 激励，且 2025 年 11 月得州公用事业委员会已批准对新建逆变器型电源的「高级电网支撑」强制要求（<a href=\"https://www.energy-storage.news/ercot-incentivises-grid-forming-bess-with-us25-million-programme/\">energy-storage.news</a>）。在澳大利亚，构网 BESS 正成为稳定超大规模数据中心供电的首选方案（<a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine-australia.com/2026/03/11/why-grid-forming-bess-is-becoming-the-preferred-solution-for-hyperscale-data-centres/\">pv-magazine-australia</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价值叠加-一套系统-多重收益\">价值叠加：一套系统、多重收益</h2><p>电网级储能的经济性来自「价值叠加」（value stacking）——同一套硬件在不同时间尺度上提供多种服务并分别计费。一个构网 BESS 可以同时参与调频备用（FCR）市场、做批发市场套利、并接入惯量服务的长期合约（<a href=\"https://www.hsfkramer.com/notes/energy/2025-posts/germany-to-launch-inertia-service-market-in-2026-new-revenue-stream-for-grid-forming-bess\">hsfkramer</a>）。下图展示典型的服务叠加结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[BESS 资产] --&gt; B[毫秒-秒级&lt;br/&gt;惯量 + 一次调频]&#10;    A --&gt; C[分钟级&lt;br/&gt;调频备用 FCR]&#10;    A --&gt; D[小时级&lt;br/&gt;峰谷套利]&#10;    A --&gt; E[季节/极端&lt;br/&gt;容量保障]&#10;    B --&gt; F[构网控制&lt;br/&gt;+ 长期合约收入]&#10;    C --&gt; G[辅助服务市场]&#10;    D --&gt; H[现货/批发市场]&#10;    E --&gt; I[容量市场 / 可靠性]\">graph TD\n    A[BESS 资产] --&gt; B[毫秒-秒级&lt;br/&gt;惯量 + 一次调频]\n    A --&gt; C[分钟级&lt;br/&gt;调频备用 FCR]\n    A --&gt; D[小时级&lt;br/&gt;峰谷套利]\n    A --&gt; E[季节/极端&lt;br/&gt;容量保障]\n    B --&gt; F[构网控制&lt;br/&gt;+ 长期合约收入]\n    C --&gt; G[辅助服务市场]\n    D --&gt; H[现货/批发市场]\n    E --&gt; I[容量市场 / 可靠性]</pre><p>调度优化的目标，是在满足荷电状态（SOC）、循环寿命与服务承诺约束下最大化总收益。简化地，运营商求解形如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max \\sum_t (\\pi_t^{arb} \\cdot p_t + \\pi^{cap} \\cdot c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1488em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的问题，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_t^{arb}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 时刻的套利电价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是充放电功率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^{cap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是容量/辅助服务报酬。BloombergNEF 预计放电时长 6 小时以上的长时储能年新增将翻两番至约 2 GW（<a href=\"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/01/27/analyst-delivers-five-trends-to-look-for-in-global-energy-storage-in-2026/\">ess-news</a>），叠加 AI 数据中心成为 2026 储能五大趋势之一——这意味着未来的价值叠加里，会越来越多出现「为数据中心提供高可靠供电」这一新维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电网级储能按放电时长分象限：秒分钟级拼功率（飞轮）、2–6 小时拼度电成本（LFP）、8–100 小时拼边际储能成本（液流、铁-空气）。</li>\n<li>LFP 凭借成本、寿命与热稳定性占据新增装机约 90%，并完成从定制工程到工厂预制「积木块」的产业化转型，LCOS 降至约 65 $/MWh。</li>\n<li>钠离子与铁基电池在 2026 年首次进入商业中试，主打摆脱锂供应链依赖；铁-空气以 ~20 $/kWh、100 小时时长补位长时可靠性，Google 30 GWh 项目是标杆。</li>\n<li>功率变换正从跟网逆变器转向构网逆变器，后者主动定锚电压频率、毫秒级响应；德国惯量市场与得州 ERCOT 激励把构网从可选变为强制。</li>\n<li>经济性来自价值叠加：同一套系统在惯量、调频、套利、容量多个尺度上分别计费；AI 数据中心正成为新增需求的强驱动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电网级储能技术","id":"电网级储能技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：按放电时长划分技术象限","id":"核心概念-按放电时长划分技术象限"},{"level":2,"text":"LFP：标准化「积木块」统治能量型市场","id":"lfp-标准化-积木块-统治能量型市场"},{"level":2,"text":"钠离子与铁基：摆脱锂依赖的两条路","id":"钠离子与铁基-摆脱锂依赖的两条路"},{"level":2,"text":"功率变换与并网：从「跟网」到「构网」","id":"功率变换与并网-从-跟网-到-构网"},{"level":2,"text":"价值叠加：一套系统、多重收益","id":"价值叠加-一套系统-多重收益"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电网平衡与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals/grid-balancing-and-dispatch"},"next":{"title":"电池储能系统 BESS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/energy-storage-systems/battery-storage-systems-bess"}}